  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Canaan Land Vegetable Marketing Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Canaan Land is a vegetable and fruit distributor in the urban Ivorian market that provides trainings and irrigation tools to smallholder farmers. Canaan Land will provide access to irrigated land to small producers for a small fee. Additionally, Canaan Land will provide the farmers with technical support in.return for the sale of their crops. Thereafter, Canaan Land will distribute the farmers products through its network of partner clients.</narrative>
  </description>
